[{"speaker":"将臣","text":"「呃！！」","art":{"background":"a3238","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"我一口气在小雨的里面射了出来。","art":{"background":"a3243","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊！」","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"与此同时，小雨也大叫出来，达到了高潮。","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"在我向她体内注入精液的时候，她的身体也在不断地轻轻颤抖。","art":{"background":"a3244","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊、啊、啊……」","art":{"background":"a3245","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「主、主人的在本座体内……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"丛雨","text":"「啊、啊，感觉到了，主人那烫烫的，正在射进来……」","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"小雨用半恍惚的神情低头看着我。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"她可爱的嘴唇上还挂着口水。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"下体则不断溢出掺杂着爱液与精液的液体。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"真是片淫荡的风景。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"但小雨那年幼的脸庞又确实是少女模样。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"},{"speaker":"","text":"少女味与女人味交织在一起，形成了富有魅力的鲜明对比。","art":{"background":"a3246","sprites":[]},"chapter":"6-4"}]